207 0 obj
<</Title(Understanding how hormone imbalances affect your stress levels is crucial for finding effective relief. When your hormones are imbalanced, it can feel like you're constantly battling against a tidal wave of stress. Simple tasks may seem daunting, and you might struggle to find moments of peace amidst the chaos of daily life. By recognizing the role hormones play in your stress levels, you can start to take steps to regain control and find relief.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 188 0 R/Next 248 0 R>>
endobj

208 0 obj
<</Title(By prioritizing your well-being and making time for these simple practices, you can begin to rebalance your hormones and reclaim a sense of calm amidst the busyness of motherhood.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 188 0 R/Prev 248 0 R>>
endobj

209 0 obj
<</Title(BREATHING EXERCISES)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 188 0 R/First 249 0 R/Last 250 0 R/Count -2/Next 251 0 R>>
endobj

