<</Title(JOURNALING)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 252 0 R/First 253 0 R/Last 254 0 R/Count -2/Next 189 0 R>>
endobj

211 0 obj
<</Title(Music has a powerful effect on emotions and can help reduce stress levels.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 189 0 R/Next 212 0 R>>
endobj

212 0 obj
<</Title(Take a few minutes to listen to your favorite calming music, focusing on the melodies and rhythms to help relax your mind and body.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 189 0 R/Prev 211 0 R>>
endobj

213 0 obj
<</Title(Watch a funny movie or TV show, listen to a comedy podcast, or spend time with loved ones who make you laugh to reap the stress-relieving benefits of laughter.)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 123 0 R/Prev 190 0 R/First 255 0 R/Last 255 0 R/Count -1/Next 191 0 R>>
endobj

